========
Herwig 7
========

This is the release of Herwig 7.3.0, a multi purpose event
generator for high energy physics.

The Herwig++ distribution contains an adapted version of LoopTools 2.6
<http://www.feynarts.de/looptools/>. 

BUILD AND INSTALL
=================
Please refer to https://herwig.hepforge.org/tutorials/ for detailed 
instructions.

The LEP-BeamSpread.in example uses ThePEG::GaussianBeamLuminosity from the
standard ThePEG library. It is installed alongside LEP.in and runs with
'Herwig read LEP-BeamSpread.in' followed by 'Herwig run LEP-BeamSpread.run'.
The example selects 45.6 GeV per beam and independent 0.221% energy spreads.
Build and install ThePEG before Herwig when updating the luminosity interface.
This branch requires a rebuild against ThePEG ABI 31:0:0. Matchbox's
IdentifiedParticleCut and PairRapidityCut now include the beam rapidity in
laboratory selections, including the pair pseudorapidity option. This changes
asymmetric fixed-beam setups such as DIS as well as Gaussian-spread runs.
Their native regression is included in 'make check'.
